<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Click Daily Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Honda Click rents at a verified 150,000 VND per day in Hanoi, placing it in the entry tier alongside the Honda Wave, Yamaha Sirius and Yamaha Mio at the same rate. This guide plans the daily rental around that number: what the rate buys, what it does not, when the daily rate is the right structure, and when the weekly rate takes over.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price, what the Click is as a machine, day-by-day budget planning, the break-even against the 700,000 VND weekly rate and the 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND monthly rate, and the extras, deposit, gear and fuel, that turn a headline rate into a real budget. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
